.width 44
.page 12
.title Quarterly Report
.heading Summary
.align justify
Revenue grew in every region this quarter, led by strong demand for the new
product line. Costs rose more slowly than revenue, so the margin improved.
.heading Regional results
.list number
North: sales up twelve percent on the back of two large contracts.

South: flat, as expected after the price change in the spring.
.list bullet
Retail held steady.

Wholesale fell slightly.
.endlist
East: the new office opened in May and is already profitable.
.endlist
.align left
.heading Outlook
We expect the next quarter to be similar, with some risk from currency
movements and the timing of the remaining contracts.
.break
.title Appendix
.heading Method
Figures are unaudited.
